{"id":"torrey:counsels-and-purposes-of-god-the","source":"torrey","name":"Counsels And Purposes Of God, The","slug":"counsels-and-purposes-of-god-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Are great — Jer 32:19.","refs":[["Jer",32,19,32,19]]},{"text":"Are wonderful — Isa 28:29.","refs":[["Isa",28,29,28,29]]},{"text":"Are immutable — Ps 33:11; Pr 19:21; Jer 4:28; Ro 9:11; Heb 6:17.","refs":[["Ps",33,11,33,11],["Prov",19,21,19,21],["Jer",4,28,4,28],["Rom",9,11,9,11],["Heb",6,17,6,17]]},{"text":"Are sovereign — Isa 40:13,14; Da 4:35.","refs":[["Isa",40,13,40,13],["Isa",40,14,40,14],["Dan",4,35,4,35]]},{"text":"Are eternal — Eph 3:11.","refs":[["Eph",3,11,3,11]]},{"text":"Are faithfulness and truth — Isa 25:1.","refs":[["Isa",25,1,25,1]]},{"text":"None can disannul — Isa 14:27.","refs":[["Isa",14,27,14,27]]},{"text":"Shall be performed — Isa 14:24; 46:11.","refs":[["Isa",14,24,14,24],["Isa",46,11,46,11]]},{"text":"The sufferings and death of Christ were according to — Ac 2:23; 4:28.","refs":[["Acts",2,23,2,23],["Acts",4,28,4,28]]},{"text":"Saints called and save according to — Ro 8:28; 2Ti 1:9.","refs":[["Rom",8,28,8,28],["2Tim",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"The union of all saints in Christ, is according to — Eph 1:9,10.","refs":[["Eph",1,9,1,9],["Eph",1,10,1,10]]},{"text":"The works of God according to — Eph 1:11.","refs":[["Eph",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Should be declared by ministers — Ac 20:27.","refs":[["Acts",20,27,20,27]]},{"text":"Attend to — Jer 49:20; 50:45.","refs":[["Jer",49,20,49,20],["Jer",50,45,50,45]]},{"text":"Secret not to be searched into — De 29:29; Mt 24:36; Ac 1:7.","refs":[["Deut",29,29,29,29],["Matt",24,36,24,36],["Acts",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Understand not. — Mic 4:12.","refs":[["Mic",4,12,4,12]]},{"text":"Despise. — Isa 5:19.","refs":[["Isa",5,19,5,19]]},{"text":"Reject. — Lu 7:30.","refs":[["Luke",7,30,7,30]]}],"refCount":31}
